+The local `pi snapshot --json --offline` command loads entries once and builds
+both daily and session reports from that same vector. Its envelope has
+`schemaVersion: 1`, `tool: "pi"`, `daily`, and `session`. The daily member uses
+the existing daily-by-agent shape; the session member uses the Pi session shape.
+The command rejects date filters, `--last`, `--jq`, `--no-cost`, and online mode.
+It writes no raw-log copies and does not reload files between report views.
+Controlled writes after capture affect the next scan, not either captured view.
